  "body": "Suniye now puts Hindi spoken help on the opening screen, moves Repeat and Slow before a long source, keeps Stop in a footer, and offers a four-line preview with the complete original available. Slow can return to the usual speed. The microphone button appears only after caregiver opt-in; experimental explanation stays under more options.\n\nEvery spoken app output uses recorded or live ElevenLabs Raju. Cached replay and bundled help need no new provider request. New narration needs internet and existing ElevenLabs credits. No new paid service or subscription was activated.\n\nThe APK builds and its signature matches the previous ElevenLabs-only release. Earlier Android 11 internal layout and Raju-help playback assertions passed at 160% fonts. Emulator System UI failures covered the capture and interrupted further runtime checks; a clean visual/touch walkthrough remains open. No physical Redmi or parent-comprehension claim is made. The source includes an offline view/media probe for a later stable test run.\n\nInstall the pilot only with a trusted family member completing setup. Evidence and the remaining family check are in outputs/suniye/docs/parent-usability.md and docs/evidence/parent-usability-check-2026-10-04.json.\n"
